{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>更新時間：10:03 2026-11-15 HKT<br/>發佈時間：10:03 2026-11-15 HKT</p>\n<p>發佈時間：10:03 2026-11-15 HKT</p><img alt=\"維港渡海泳｜「優悠組」第四組取消下水 現場廣播指「水流太急」\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/2437ea847db918db14a4b8b9fac79c56/2026-11/A1_0_7.jpg\"/><p>年度活動「維港泳2026」今日（15日）早上舉行。據了解，賽事「優悠組」第四組大批參加者未下水，賽事取消。據現場廣播，由於水流太急。</p><p>大會表示，第四組大批選手未有落水，現場正有措施跟進處理，受影響人數、取消賽事的原因有待確認。</p><p>最Hit</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-15T02:13:56.052635+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":196,"images":1,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-15T02:03:09+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-15T02:07:18.823536+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-15T02:07:18.823536+00:00","content_hash":"526d65741cc23fb12d81a455db0939f39f577347b86bc4a07fa71eb901b7bb9d","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}